 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "availability[i] lists the days listing i is available (any order, duplicates allowed). Return every way to cover every day start..end: first all single listings [i] covering the whole range in ascending i, then all ordered pairs [i, j] with i != j such that for some split day k (start <= k < end) listing i covers start..k and listing j covers k+1..end, in ascending (i, j) order. Pairs are listed even when one of the two listings could cover the range alone (inference).",
  "provenance": [
